# Multiplexer (2:1)

## Goal

Learn how to build a 2-to-1 multiplexer in Verilog and understand how selection logic is used to route data inside digital systems.

## Concepts Learned

- module
- input
- output
- wire
- assign
- conditional operator (`?:`)
- selection logic
- combinational logic

